                                                "sense_id": "4004de96-364a-3b24-b346-860e53f4b541",
                                                "text": "I'm sure your being so ventripotent is useful in county fair competitions, George, but it's driving our bakery into the ground, so we're replacing you."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
